{"unit_id":"WizisCool__dsh-ears#card-zh","repo":"WizisCool/dsh-ears","commit":"fa0b7adbe8fa1e8a41835ef17f6287b486591892","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ears 是面向 DSH Web 与 Desktop 的语音输入插件，在会话输入框旁加入麦克风按钮、录音状态栏和独立设置页。它支持浏览器 Web Speech、本地 Whisper，以及 Groq、Deepgram、百炼、腾讯云、MiMo、硅基流动、火山引擎和自定义 OpenAI 兼容语音识别；可将识别文本交给 DSH 已配置的模型润色，并保留为可编辑草稿供用户检查后手动发送。设置可管理识别语言、快捷键、模型和云服务凭据；云识别需相应账号与密钥，本地 Whisper 需下载模型。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:63","src/asr/providers.ts:255","src/polish/service.ts:559"]}
{"unit_id":"WizisCool__dsh-ears#card-en","repo":"WizisCool/dsh-ears","commit":"fa0b7adbe8fa1e8a41835ef17f6287b486591892","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-ears adds voice input to the DSH composer with a microphone, recognition dock, and settings page. It supports browser speech recognition, local Whisper, and cloud ASR. Transcripts can be polished with a DSH model and remain editable for review and manual sending.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:63","src/asr/providers.ts:255","src/polish/service.ts:559"]}
